g-endian.\n\n### VectorBytes.pushI32BEFailing\n\n```ceesafe\npublic fn pushI32BEFailing(v: borrow mut Vector<u8, FailingAllocator>, x: i32) -> Result<void, AllocError>\n```\n\nAppe",
